WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.167
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night." We hope

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:05.133
you're all doing well tonight
and now let's get to the news.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:08.400
House minority leader Kevin
McCarthy yesterday criticized

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.734
Russian President Vladimir Putin
and said,

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.601
"I think Putin is evil.
I think he's a dictator."

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.067
Added McCarthy, "That said,

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.434
I'd obviously still vote for him
in 2024."

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.667
President Biden signed
an executive order yesterday

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.067
on cryptocurrency.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.000
The order specifies that it can

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.667
no longer be
your entire personality.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:31.100
"Yo, you pimps talkin' crypto?"

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:35.100
According to newly released
documents,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.767
former president Trump
refinanced Trump Tower

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.133
last month and took out
a $100 million loan.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:42.801
It turns out the guy
he usually asks for money

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:44.300
is pretty busy right now.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.501
During a visit yesterday to
the Ukrainian Cultural Center

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:53.467
in London, Britain's Prince
William said that the ongoing

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:56.868
Russian invasion of Ukraine
makes him feel "useless."

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:58.300
Really?

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.701
You'd think British royalty
would be used to that by now.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:06.100
Former Trump White House senior
adviser Stephen Miller revealed

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.601
in a new legal filing
that he is still on

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.367
his parents' T-Mobile
family plan.

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:12.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.167
Oh, man that is embarrassing.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.000
They're on T-Mobile?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:21.434
Nintendo announced yesterday
that it will postpone

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:24.367
the release of a new war game
in light of recent world news,

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.234
and due to gas prices,
the new "Mario Kart."

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:33.167
The assistant principal at an
elementary school in Mississippi

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.667
was fired last week after
he read the children's book

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:38.868
"I Need a New Butt"
to a second grade class,

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:41.033
following complaints from
parents that he used words like

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:44.033
"butt" and "fart," or as they
call it, critical race theory.

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:50.968
The dating app Tinder announced
yesterday that users will now

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:53.434
be able to run background checks
on potential dates.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:56.067
Although, wasn't everyone
already checking the background?

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:58.334
"Alright, she's cute,
but what's going on behind her?

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:00.667
Is that a monster energy drink?"

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:01.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:04.434
"Oh, and looks like --
Yeah, that's a Chihuahua.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.067
I'm swiping left!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:10.133
Tiger Woods was inducted into
the Golf Hall of Fame yesterday

00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:12.033
in Florida,
but he still hasn't heard back

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:13.667
from the Driving Hall of Fame.

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:16.701
[ Laughter, crowd ohhs ]

00:02:16.701 --> 00:02:18.901
There's still time.
There's still time.

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:21.434
He just hasn't heard.

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:24.467
And finally, in a new interview,
a Virginia couple claimed that

00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:26.100
in their over-30-year marriage,

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.834
they have never had
a single argument.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:29.801
And if you want to know
what their secret is --

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:31.534
lying in interviews.

00:02:31.534 --> 00:02:32.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.467
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

